<h2 id="seattle-market-opportunity">The Seattle Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>From Queen Anne and Magnolia to the Eastside — Bellevue, Kirkland, and Mercer Island — Seattle kitchens favor Pacific-Northwest contemporary design with natural materials and clean lines. The market leans toward natural wood tones, warm neutrals, matte finishes, and clean lines that suit the region's modern and craftsman homes. The city's remodel market favors transitional-to-modern work with two-tone schemes and warm-wood islands, while the affluent Eastside — backed by the tech economy — drives demand for sleek <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Seattle dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

